[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7263.43, "timestamp": "02:01:03", "text": "服务器重置了一次，然后就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7266.31, "timestamp": "02:01:06", "text": "这事儿就像是把我拉了回来一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7269.03, "timestamp": "02:01:09", "text": "我当时在一两千个街区之外。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7270.79, "timestamp": "02:01:10", "text": "完全不同的生物群落，而我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7272.95, "timestamp": "02:01:12", "text": "妈的，我不干了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7275.39, "timestamp": "02:01:15", "text": "我身上也发生过类似的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7277.95, "timestamp": "02:01:17", "text": "很多次，我希望那样的事情能够发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7280.75, "timestamp": "02:01:20", "text": "我最需要它的时候就是我去世的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7283.27, "timestamp": "02:01:23", "text": "延迟发生时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7291.15, "timestamp": "02:01:31", "text": "没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7292.55, "timestamp": "02:01:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7298.149, "timestamp": "02:01:38", "text": "兄弟，我的武器也丢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7302.109, "timestamp": "02:01:42", "text": "哦，没关系，有时候我们必须面对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7304.069, "timestamp": "02:01:44", "text": "有了这个，我们就得到了我们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7306.149, "timestamp": "02:01:46", "text": "传送功能很快就要上线了，所以等着瞧吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7309.55, "timestamp": "02:01:49", "text": "等待奇迹发生，嗨！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7311.55, "timestamp": "02:01:51", "text": "与此同时，我只想让你来做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7312.99, "timestamp": "02:01:52", "text": "知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7315.149, "timestamp": "02:01:55", "text": "哦，他得到了"}]